u093f\u0916\u093e\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902 \u2014 child\u2192parent (C2P) retrieval accurate, \u092a\u0930 parent\u2192child (P2C) underperforming?\n\n- **H1 (primary, one-sided, pre-registered):** matched families \u092a\u0930 accuracy(P2C) < accuracy(C2P), direction effect statistically reliable (one-sided \u03b1 = 0.025) **\u0914\u0930** pre-specified minimum effect size \u0938\u0947 \u090a\u092a\u0930 (\u00a75-B thresholds)\u0964\n- **H0:** \u0915\u094b\u0908 reliable direction difference \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902\u0964 **H2 (counter-directional):** reliable reverse asymmetry \u2014 interpretation rules \u00a75-B \u092e\u0947\u0902 pre-specified\u0964\n- Design-neutral: \u0915\u094b\u0908 expected outcome postulate \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0917\u092f\u093e; support/null/counter \u0924\u0940\u0928\u094b\u0902 pre-registered rules \u0938\u0947 interpret \u0939\u094b\u0902\u0917\u0947\u0964\n\n**Operating definitions (fixed requirement #3 \u0915\u0947 \u0905\u0928\u0941\u0930\u0942\u092a):**\n- *\"Accurately retrieve\"* = model output \u0915\u093e gold-list (Wikidata+biography union, aliases \u0938\u092e\u0947\u0924) \u0938\u0947 rubric-\u0906\u0927\u093e\u0930\u093f\u0924 match (\u00a74)\u0964\n- *\"Underperform\"* = pooled paired direction odds ratio **OR_dir \u2264 0.80 \u0914\u0930 \u0394acc = acc(C2P) \u2212 acc(P2C) \u2265 5 percentage points**, \u0938\u093e\u0925 \u092e\u0947\u0902 reliable one-sided test; \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 criteria \u090f\u0915 \u0938\u093e\u0925 \u0905\u0928\u093f\u0935\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f\u0964\n\n---\n\n## \u00a71 Stimulus set construction\n\n**1.1 Gold source (researcher-confirmed choice: \u0935\u093f\u0915\u0932\u094d\u092a 3):**\n- Primary: **Wikidata P22 (father) / P25 (mother) / P40 (child)** \u0938\u0947 directed edges \u0916\u0940\u0902\u091a\u0928\u093e; \u0939\u0930 candidate edge \u0915\u093e **biography/IMDb cross-verification**; \u091c\u094b union \u092e\u0947\u0902 agreement \u0939\u0948 \u0935\u0947 \u0939\u0940 items; disagreements \u2192 `flagged` \u2192 primary \u0938\u0947 exclude (log maintained)\u0964\n- **Mandatory sensitivity check (fixed requirement #1):** \u090f\u0915 **fully manual curated list** (~40 families, stratification quota proportionally maintain \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0941\u090f, independent curator \u0926\u094d\u0935\u093e\u0930\u093e \u092c\u093f\u0928\u093e Wikidata \u0926\u0947\u0916\u0928\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 tier/era labels) alternate gold \u0915\u0947 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u092e\u0947\u0902; primary direction effect \u0909\u0938 \u092a\u0930 \u0926\u094b\u092c\u093e\u0930\u093e estimate \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e \u2192 exclusion-driven sample change \u0915\u093e effect report \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e\u0964\n\n**1.2 Sampling frame \u0914\u0930 size (working assumption: N = 120 families; \u00a76 \u0926\u0947\u0916\u0947\u0902):**\n- Grid quotas (per cell \u2248 10): **fame tier** {mega-famous, mid-tier, niche} \u00d7 **era** {children born pre-1970, 1970\u20132000, post-2000} \u2014 plus domain balance {film/music, politics/royalty, sports, business/other} \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0938\u0947 \u0915\u092e-\u0938\u0947-\u0915\u092e 3 domains \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u093f tier\u0964\n- Fame tier operationalization (pre-specified): reference-corpus name frequency (stable snapshot corpus, e.g., Wikipedia pageviews/abstracts snapshot) + log Wikidata sitelink count; \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u093e composite, quantile cutoffs\u0964\n- **Familiarity covariate (per entity):** held-out calibration model \u092a\u0930 single-name probe \"Who is {X}? What is {X} known for?\" \u0915\u0940 rubric-scored specificity (0\u20133) + corpus frequency\u0964 `fame_diff = log(fame_parent+1) \u2212 log(fame_child+1)`\u0964\n- **Subsets:** `parent-more-famous` (fame_diff > +0.5 log units), `child-more-famous` (< \u22120.5), `balanced` (else) \u2014 \u00a75-C \u092e\u0947\u0902 direction effect \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0905\u0932\u0917 estimate \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e\u0964\n\n**1.3 Inclusion/exclusion rules (pre-registered):**\n- Include: \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 entities standalone-notable; parent\u2013child relation gold-consistent; relation type \u2208 {biological, adoptive, legal} (type field \u092e\u0947\u0902 label; sensitivity \u092e\u0947\u0902 biological-only)\u0964\n- Exclude: live-disputed relations; gold disagreement; both entities niche-tier AND composite familiarity bottom decile (floor-effect guard \u2014 reason logged); non-human entities\u0964\n- **Name-collision protocol:** \u091c\u0939\u093e\u0901 parent/child same \u092f\u093e highly-similar name \u0930\u0916\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902 (Jr./Sr./same-name dynasty) \u2192 \u0939\u0930 probe \u092e\u0947\u0902 disambiguating appositive \u0905\u0928\u093f\u0935\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f (\"\u2026the actor born 1955\u2026\"); `collision_flag=1`; sensitivity \u092e\u0947\u0902 collision items \u0905\u0932\u0917 estimate; alias list \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 name variants gold-side\u0964\n- **Multi-child:** gold \u092a\u0915\u094d\u0937 \u092a\u0930 **children \u0915\u0940 complete list + aliases** store; answer cardinality \u00a74 \u0915\u0947 set-recall protocol \u0938\u0947 harmonize\u0964\n\n**1.4 Item file schema (JSONL, one row/family):**\n```json\n{\"family_id\":\"F041\",\"domain\":\"film\",\"tier\":\"mid\",\"era\":\"1970-2000\",\n \"parent\":{\"qid\":\"Q\u2026\",\"name\":\"\u2026\",\"aliases\":[\"\u2026\"],\"fame_logfreq\":6.1,\"fame_spec\":3,\"era\":\"1952\"},\n \"child\":{\"qid\":\"Q\u2026\",\"name\":\"\u2026\",\"aliases\":[\"\u2026\"],\"fame_logfreq\":7.0,\"fame_spec\":3},\n \"children_set\":[{\"qid\":\"\u2026\",\"name\":\"\u2026\",\"aliases\":[\"\u2026\"]}, \u2026],\n \"relation_type\":\"biological\",\"collision_flag\":0,\n \"prose_context_parent\":\"\u2026\",\"prose_context_child\":\"\u2026\",\n \"gold_source\":\"union\",\"agreement\":\"both\",\"fame_diff\":-0.9}\n```\n\n---\n\n## \u00a72 Probes \u0914\u0930 prompt formats\n\n**2.1 Probe templates (\u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u093f family, \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u093f direction, 2 equivalent templates T1/T2 \u2014 measurement-noise reduction):**\n- C2P: \"Who is the parent of {CHILD}{appositive}?\" / \"Name the father or mother of {CHILD}{appositive}.\"\n- P2C: \"Name one child of {PARENT}{appositive}.\" / \"Who is a child of {PARENT}{appositive}?\"\n- \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 directions \u092e\u0947\u0902 identical syntactic frame family; answer expectation set-recall protocol \u0938\u0947 harmonized (\u00a74)\u0964\n\n**2.2 Conditions:**\n- **C1 (primary): zero-shot direct** \u2014 \u0915\u0947\u0902 primary hypothesis test\u0964\n- **C2: zero-shot + disambiguating prose context** (1 sentence, gold-derived, direction-symmetric information load \u2014 context \u092e\u0947\u0902 target entity \u0915\u093e \u0928\u093e\u092e \u0915\u092d\u0940 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902)\u0964\n- **C3: few-shot k=5, direction-balanced** (exemplars 2 C2P + 2 P2C + 1 unrelated; exemplar families held-out test items \u0938\u0947 disjoint; exemplar order + direction counterbalanced) \u2014 directionality \u092a\u0930 few-shot \u0915\u0947 modulation \u0915\u093e own test\u0964\n- Item order \u0939\u0930 model\u00d7condition \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f seeded-randomize; direction adjacent-repeat guard (\u090f\u0915 \u0939\u0940 family \u0915\u0947 \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 probes \u2265 25 items \u0926\u0942\u0930\u0940 \u092a\u0930, order direction Counterbalanced)\u0964\n\n**2.3 Decoding:** Primary **temperature 0** (deterministic; \u091c\u0939\u093e\u0902 exact-determinism \u0928 \u092e\u093f\u0932\u0947 lowest available + logged)\u0964 Secondary: **temp 0.7 \u00d7 3 seeds** (robustness plane only; primary inference \u092e\u0947\u0902 pool \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902)\u0964\n\n---\n\n## \u00a73 Models \u0914\u0930 condition plane\n\n**3.1 Recommended plane (slots; budget confirmed \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u2014 fabricated resources \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u093f\u090f \u091c\u093e \u0930\u0939\u0947):** 4\u20136 model slots, \u22652 vendors, 2 size classes:\n| Slot | Class | \u0909\u0926\u093e\u0939\u0930\u0923-\u0935\u0930\u094d\u0917 (placeholder, commitment \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902) |\n|---|---|---|\n| M1, M2 | flagship, vendor A/B | frontier closed API |\n| M3, M4 | mid-size, vendor A/B | same vendors \u0915\u093e lighter tier |\n| M5 (, M6) | open-weight small/large | 7\u201370B class, local or hosted |\n**3.2 Documented budget fallback (fixed requirement #4):** minimal variant = **2 flagship (different vendors) + 1 open-weight** (M1, M2, M5); condition set C1+C3 only (C2 dropped); power \u00a76 \u0915\u0947 pooled-model calculation \u092e\u0947\u0902 accordingly reduce \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e \u2014 pre-registered \u0924\u094c\u0930 \u092a\u0930 declared\u0964\n**3.3 Load per model:** primary plane \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u093f model = 2 directions \u00d7 2 templates \u00d7 3 conditions \u00d7 120 families = **1,440 calls (temp-0)**; secondary plane \u092e\u0947\u0902 3\u00d7 \u0909\u0938\u0938\u0947 \u0905\u0927\u093f\u0915\u0964 Total budget table design doc \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u0925 execution phase \u092e\u0947\u0902 provide \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e\u0964\n**3.4 API/config logging:** \u0939\u0930 call \u0915\u093e raw response, config, timestamp, model version/snapshot ID append-only log \u092e\u0947\u0902 (version drift audit \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f)\u0964\n\n---\n\n## \u00a74 Scoring / adjudication rubric (pre-registered)\n\n**4.1 Correctness:**\n- C2P: output entity \u0915\u093e parent-gold (P22/P25 target; parent-side single) \u0938\u0947 match\u0964\n- P2C: **set-based recall protocol (fixed requirement #2b):** \"name any one valid child\" \u2014 model \u0915\u093e \u0915\u094b\u0908 \u092d\u0940 entity-level answer children_set \u0915\u0947 \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 member \u0938\u0947 match \u2192 correct; multi-entity answers \u092a\u0930 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u093e named entity primary scoring-target, extras \u092a\u0930 penalty \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 (log only)\u0964\n- **Sensitivity (a):** single-child-only families subset \u092a\u0930 repeat\u0964\n- Match ladder: (i) exact normalized name; (ii) alias-list hit; (iii) QID/unique-identifier mention; (iv) unresolved \u2192 adjudication\u0964\n\n**4.2 Response categories (direction-wise report \u0905\u0928\u093f\u0935\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f):** `correct` / `incorrect-entity` / `refusal` (\"don't know\") / `hedged-partial` (qualified \u092f\u093e low-confidence \u0928\u093e\u092e)\u0964 Primary analysis \u092e\u0947\u0902 refusal/hedged = incorrect; sensitivity \u092e\u0947\u0902 exclusion\u0964 Direction-wise refusal/hedged rates \u092e\u0941\u0916\u094d\u092f-table \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u2014 bias refusal-behaviour artefact \u0928 \u0939\u094b \u092f\u0939 \u0926\u093f\u0916\u093e\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f\u0964\n\n**4.3 LLM-assisted adjudication + manual double-coding:**\n- LLM adjudicator (test-plane \u0938\u0947 \u092d\u093f\u0928\u094d\u0928 model family) unresolved matches \u0915\u094b rubric \u0938\u0947 classify \u0915\u0930\u0947; adjudicator \u0915\u094b **direction label blinded** \u0930\u0939\u0947 (\u092f\u093e\u0928\u0940 \u092f\u0939 \u0928 \u092a\u0924\u093e \u0939\u094b \u092f\u0939 probe C2P \u0925\u0940 \u092f\u093e P2C \u2014 \u0635\u0631\u0641 entity-pair \u0914\u0930 answer \u0926\u093f\u0916\u0947)\u0964\n- **Manual double-coding subset:** stratified random 20% (direction \u00d7 tier \u00d7 category \u0938\u0947 strata), \u0926\u094b independent human coders, blinded\u0964 **Inter-rater agreement: Cohen's \u03ba; gate \u03ba \u2265 0.85** \u2014 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0924\u094b rubric revise \u0914\u0930 re-code\u0964 LLM-vs-human agreement \u0909\u0938\u0940 subset \u092a\u0930 report; disagreement rate direction-wise (differential grading bias \u0915\u0940 \u091c\u093e\u0901\u091a)\u0964\n\n---\n\n## \u00a75 Analysis plan (pre-registered order)\n\n**A. Primary test (plane C1, temp-0):**\n1. Per model: family-level paired accuracy, **\u0394acc**, McNemar exact test (discordant pairs), one-sided p for H1; **two-sided 95% CIs** (cluster-bootstrap over families, 10,000 resamples) \u0394acc \u0914\u0930 OR \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u2014 researcher instruction \u0915\u0947 \u0905\u0928\u0941\u0930\u0942\u092a one-sided hypothesis, two-sided CI report\u0964\n2. Pooled primary: **GLMM** `correct ~ direction + (1|family) + (1|model) + direction:model`, report OR_dir = exp(direction coefficient)\u0964\n\n**B. Pre-registered decision table (null \u0914\u0930 counter-directional \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0947 rules \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u0938\u0947):**\n| Result | Rule | Interpretation |\n|---|---|---|\n| Reliable one-sided (\u03b1=.025) AND OR\u22640.80 AND \u0394acc\u22655pp | SUPPORT | H1 supported (claim only for tested model plane) |\n| Reliable \u092a\u0930 OR>0.80 \u092f\u093e \u0394acc<5pp | PARTIAL/SMALL | statistically detectable \u092a\u0930 practically small \u2014 effect-size-first report |\n| Not reliable, CI excludes OR\u22640.80 \u0914\u0930 OR\u22651.25 | NULL | practical-equivalence language + power caveat |\n| Reliable reverse AND OR\u207b\u00b9 thresholds meet | COUNTER | H2 supported |\n| Direction \u0935\u093f\u0930\u0941\u0926\u094d\u0927 models/conditions \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092d\u093f\u0928\u094d\u0928 | MIXED | moderation \u0915\u0947 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u092e\u0947\u0902 report; cherry-picking \u092e\u0928\u093e \u2014 interaction test \u0938\u0947 support \u091a\u093e\u0939\u093f\u090f |\n| \u00a75-C confound checks fail (\u0928\u0940\u091a\u0947) | CONFOUND-SUSPECT | headline claim withhold; confound-adjusted result primary |\n\n**C. Confound-isolation battery (fixed design strength):**\n- **Fame:** GLMM `correct ~ direction + fame_diff + direction:fame_subset + era + tier + child_count + collision_flag + relation_type + (1|family) + (1|model)`\u0964 Pass-criterion: direction effect `parent-more-famous` \u0914\u0930 `child-more-famous` \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 subsets \u092e\u0947\u0902 same-signed \u0930\u0939\u0947 (fame-asymmetry artefact \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u092f\u0939\u0940 fingerprint \u0939\u0948); direction:fame_subset interaction formally test\u0964\n- **Exposure/recency:** era-stratified effects; post-2000-children (low-training-exposure proxy) subset \u2014 leakage definitive control \u0938\u0902\u092d\u0935 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902, \u0907\u0938\u0947 Limitation \u092e\u0947\u0902 report (researcher-confirmed policy: \u091b\u093f\u092a\u093e\u0928\u093e \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902)\u0964\n- **Cardinality:** \u00a74 \u0915\u0947 single-child sensitivity \u0938\u0947 answer-set-size artefact \u0905\u0932\u0917\u0964\n\n**D. Sensitivity battery (pre-listed, secondary):** (1) **alternate manual-curated gold \u092a\u0930 primary re-estimation (fixed requirement #1, \u0905\u0928\u093f\u0935\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f)**; (2) single-child-only; (3) mega-famous-only; (4) pre-cutoff era only; (5) C1 vs C3 (few-shot moderation); (6) temp-0 vs temp-0.7 seeds; (7) refusal-as-exclusion; (8) collision items excluded\u0964\n\n**E. Multiplicity:** Primary = C1 temp-0 pooled direction test (\u090f\u0915)\u0964 \u0938\u092c \u0915\u0941\u091b secondary; secondary family \u092e\u0947\u0902 BH-FDR; decision table \u0915\u093e SUPPORT \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932 primary + confound-pass \u092a\u0930\u0964\n\n---\n\n## \u00a76 Power \u0914\u0930 coverage rationale (fixed requirement #5 \u2014 pilot \u092a\u0930 \u091f\u093e\u0932\u0928\u093e \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902)\n\n**Method 1 (closed-form reference, McNemar/family-level, Bender et al. formula; design-stage computation):** input working assumptions: N=120 families, mean accuracy \u22480.80 \u2192 discordance p_d \u22480.20, one-sided \u03b1=0.025, power=0.80\u0964 **\u0917\u0923\u0928\u093e-\u092a\u0930\u093f\u0923\u093e\u092e (design arithmetic, experimental result \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902):** \u0907\u0938 plane \u092e\u0947\u0902 detectable-effect limit **OR \u2248 0.28** (\u0905\u0930\u094d\u0925\u093e\u0924\u094d N=120 single-attempt \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932 strong asymmetry \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f powered \u0939\u0948)\u0964 Reference gradient: N=200 \u2192 OR\u22480.39; N=350 \u2192 OR\u22480.50\u0964 **\u0928\u093f\u0939\u093f\u0924\u093e\u0930\u094d\u0925 honestly pre-registered:** N=120 \u092a\u0930 null \u092e\u093f\u0932\u0928\u0947 \u092a\u0930 \"no effect\" \u0915\u0939\u0928\u093e invalid \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e (underpowered zone OR\u2208(0.28,0.80)); decision table \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092f\u0939 caveat fixed \u0939\u0948\u0964\n**Method 2 (primary power basis \u2014 probe-level GLMM simulation, fully specified):** execution-\u092a\u0942\u0930\u094d\u0935 simulation (\u0915\u094b\u0908 model involvement \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902, pure statistics): inputs = pilot \u0938\u0947 estimated p_d, per-family ICC \u03c1 (gold-fact difficulty clustering), k=2 templates/direction, between-model correlation; generator = logistic GLMM with direction OR grid {0.2\u20261.0}; 2,000 sims/point; **N selection rule:** N = smallest {120, 180, 240, 350} \u091c\u093f\u0938\u092e\u0947\u0902 **OR=0.5 \u092a\u0930 \u226580% power** (probe-level) \u092e\u093f\u0932\u0947; quota grid proportional scale\u0964 Working assumption N=120 coverage floor \u0930\u0939\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948; simulated requirement >120 \u0939\u094b \u0924\u094b N \u090a\u092a\u0930 \u092c\u0922\u093c\u0947\u0917\u093e \u2014 decision execution \u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 pre-registration addendum \u092e\u0947\u0902 freeze\u0964\n**Pilot = refinement only:** ~20 families \u00d7 1 model, \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932 p_d/ICC/fame-distribution estimate \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f; hypothesis test \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902; pilot data final items \u092e\u0947\u0902 reuse \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902\u0964\n\n---\n\n## \u00a77 Pre-registration checklist (execution \u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 freeze)\n\u2610 Hypotheses H1/H0/H2 + one-sided \u03b1=0.025 \u2610 Primary metric + plane (C1 temp-0 pooled GLMM) \u2610 Effect-size thresholds (OR\u22640.80, \u0394acc\u22655pp) \u2610 Decision table (\u00a75-B) \u2610 Exclusion rules (\u00a71.3) + gold-disagreement log \u2610 Condition/model plane \u092f\u093e declared fallback \u2610 Scoring rubric + \u03ba\u22650.85 gate + adjudicator blinding \u2610 Power method + N rule (\u00a76) \u2610 **Stopping rules: fixed N; \u0915\u094b\u0908 interim significance peeking \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902; pilot \u0938\u0947 parameters update allowed, hypotheses \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902; \u0915\u094b\u0908 post-hoc threshold change \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u2014 deviations deviation-log \u092e\u0947\u0902, primary unaffected** \u2610 Analysis scripts code-reviewed \u0935 freeze \u2610 Deviation policy + reporting checklist (all conditions reported, failures \u0938\u092e\u0947\u0924)\u0964\n\n---\n\n## \u00a78 Feasibility \u0914\u0930 artifact plan (design-only delivery)\n- **\u0905\u092d\u0940 delivered (\u092f\u0939 document):** rationale, controls, sampling + gold protocol, templates, scoring rubric, decision rules, analysis spec + \u0928\u0940\u091a\u0947 pseudo-code, power methods (\u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902) + computed reference tables, pre-registration checklist\u0964\n- **Sandbox inventory (design-stage facts, experiment \u0915\u0947 proof \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902):** /workspace \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932 task.json; \u0915\u094b\u0908 dataset/code/eval scaffolding \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902; \u0915\u094b\u0908 ML library \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902; network disabled \u2014 \u0905\u0924\u0903 stimulus acquisition (Wikidata dump/API), model inference \u0914\u0930 pilot \u0938\u092c **execution phase \u092e\u0947\u0902, deferred**\u0964 Design \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0907\u0928\u0915\u0940 \u0906\u0935\u0936\u094d\u092f\u0915\u0924\u093e \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0925\u0940\u0964\n- **Execution phase \u0915\u094b \u091a\u093e\u0939\u093f\u090f:** network \u092f\u093e pre-supplied Wikidata dump + snapshot corpus; model API access/weights; `pandas, statsmodels/brms (R), scipy`; artifact layout: `items.jsonl`, `raw_responses.jsonl`, `scores.csv`, `analysis/01_primary.py\u202604_sensitivity.py`\u0964\n\n## \u00a79 Spec / pseudo-code\n```python\n# --- item build (execution phase) ---\nfor pair in wikidata_edges(P22|P25|P40):\n    v = cross_verify_biography_IMDb(pair)          # 0/1/uncertain\n    if v == \"both\": item = make_item(pair)         # union primary\n    elif v == \"disagree\": log_and_exclude(pair)\nitem = assign_quotas(tier, era, domain); add_fame(item); flag_collisions(item)\nassert children_set_complete(item) and aliases_loaded(item)\n\n# --- runner ---\nfor model in MODEL_SLOTS:                          # recommended \u092f\u093e declared fallback\n  for cond in [C1, C2, C3]:                        # C1 primary\n    order = seeded_shuffle(items, model, cond)     # direction-repeat guard\n    for item in order:\n      for direction in [C2P, P2C]:\n        for template in [T1, T2]:\n          call_and_log(model, cond, direction, template, item, temp=0)\n  if PLANE.secondary: secondary_plane(model, temp=0.7, seeds=[s1,s2,s3])\n\n# --- scoring ---\nfor resp in raw_responses:\n    label = match_ladder(resp, gold_for(resp.direction))   # exact|alias|qid|unresolved\n    if label is None: label = adjudicate_blinded(resp)     # direction-label blinded LLM\nkappa = irr_check(double_coded_20pct_subset())             # gate: kappa >= 0.85\n\n# --- analysis (pre-registered order) ---\nprimary: per-model McNemar + bootstrap CIs  ->  pooled GLMM:\n    correct ~ direction + (1|family) + (1|model) + direction:model\nconfound: correct ~ direction + fame_diff + direction:fame_subset + era + tier\n          + child_count + collision_flag + relation_type + (1|family) + (1|model)\ndecision_table(primary, confound_checks)   # thresholds: OR<=0.80, dAcc>=5pp, p_1side<.025\nsensitivity: [manual_curated_gold, single_child_only, mega_famous_only,\n              pre_cutoff_only, C1_vs_C3, temp0_vs_seeds, refusal_excluded]  # BH-FDR\n```\n\n## \u00a710 Limitations (honest, fixed policy)\n(1) Training-exposure definitive control \u0905\u0938\u0902\u092d\u0935 \u2014 era/familiarity proxies, limitation \u0915\u0947 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u092e\u0947\u0902 report\u0964 (2) Gold source \u0915\u0940 coverage/recency bias; disagreement-exclusion sample \u092c\u0926\u0932 \u0938\u0915\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u2014 curated-gold sensitivity \u0907\u0938\u0940 \u0932\u093f\u090f mandatory\u0964 (3) Results \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932 tested model plane \u0924\u0915; version drift logged \u092a\u0930 controlled \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902\u0964 (4) N=120 primary plane OR\u22480.28 \u0924\u0915 \u0939\u0940 powered (design arithmetic) \u2014 N rule \u00a76 \u0938\u0947 fix \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e\u0964 (5) Fame operationalization proxy \u0939\u0948, ground truth \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902\u0964\n\n**\u0938\u0916\u094d\u0924 \u0938\u0940\u092e\u093e\u0913\u0902 \u0915\u093e \u092a\u093e\u0932\u0928:** \u0907\u0938 deliverable \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0915\u094b\u0908 execution \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902, \u0915\u094b\u0908 model inference \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902, \u0915\u094b\u0908 fabricated result \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902, \u0915\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u092d\u0940 \"\u091a\u0932\u093e\u092f\u093e \u0917\u092f\u093e\" \u0915\u093e \u0926\u093e\u0935\u093e \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902; inventory/power-arithmetic commands design-stage checks \u0939\u0948\u0902, experiment \u0915\u0947 proof \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902\u0964", "evidence": "Repository observations: /workspace \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932 task.json (design-only note \u0938\u0939\u093f\u0924); \u0915\u094b\u0908 dataset/code/scaffolding \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902; system Python 3.14.4, \u0915\u094b\u0908 ML/data library \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902, network disabled (\u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u0915\u0947 turn \u092e\u0947\u0902 verified) \u2014 \u0905\u0924\u0903 design execution \u0938\u0947 \u092e\u0941\u0915\u094d\u0924 \u0930\u0916\u0940 \u0917\u0908 \u0914\u0930 acquisition/inference execution phase \u092e\u0947\u0902 defer \u0915\u093f\u090f\u0964 Design-stage statistical arithmetic (experiment \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902): Bender-closed-form McNemar power calculations \u091c\u094b \u00a76 \u0915\u0940 reference \u0938\u0902\u0916\u094d\u092f\u093e\u090f\u0901 \u0926\u0947\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0902 \u2014 one-sided \u03b1=0.025, power .80, p_d=0.20 \u092a\u0930: N=120 \u2192 detectable OR\u22480.28; N=200 \u2192 OR\u22480.39; N=350 \u2192 OR\u22480.50; \u092f\u0947 assumed-input \u0917\u0923\u0928\u093e\u090f\u0901 \u0939\u0948\u0902, \u0915\u094b\u0908 model/data involvement \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902\u0964 Researcher-confirmed fixed choices \u091c\u094b design \u092e\u0947\u0902 embed \u0915\u093f\u090f: gold option-3 union + mandatory manual-curated sensitivity; set-recall primary (b) + single-child sensitivity (a); pre-registered underperform thresholds (OR\u22640.80, \u0394acc\u22655pp, one-sided test + two-sided CIs, null/counter interpretation rules); recommended 4\u20136 model plane + documented 2-flagship+1-open-weight budget fallback; working-assumption N=120 \u092a\u0930 specified power method + pilot-as-refinement; anvil items (\u03ba\u22650.85 double-coding rubric, direction-wise refusal/hedged reporting, collision disambiguation protocol, pre-registration checklist with stopping rules) \u00a74/\u00a77 \u092e\u0947\u0902\u0964", "assumptions": ["\u092f\u0939 complete design deliverable \u0939\u0948; execution (item acquisition, model calls, pilot) \u090f\u0915 \u092a\u0943\u0925\u0915 future phase \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e", "Wikidata dump/API, biography sources, model API access \u0914\u0930 required Python/R libraries execution phase \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0909\u092a\u0932\u092c\u094d\u0927 \u0939\u094b\u0902\u0917\u0947 (\u0907\u0938 sandbox \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902)", "Model slot list placeholder \u0939\u0948 \u2014 vendor/budget commitment \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902; fallback plane pre-declared \u0939\u0948 \u0915\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0902\u0915\u093f budget unconfirmed unknown \u0939\u0948", "N=120 families working assumption coverage floor \u0939\u0948; \u00a76 \u0915\u0940 simulation rule \u0938\u0947 pre-execution freeze \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092c\u0922\u093c \u0938\u0915\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948", "Power reference \u0938\u0902\u0916\u094d\u092f\u093e\u090f\u0901 assumed pilot inputs (mean acc\u22480.80, p_d\u22480.20) \u092a\u0930 \u092c\u0902\u0926-\u0930\u0942\u092a \u0917\u0923\u0928\u093e\u090f\u0901 \u0939\u0948\u0902; pilot \u0907\u0928\u094d\u0939\u0940\u0902 parameters \u0915\u094b refine \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0917\u093e \u2014 \u0915\u094b\u0908 empirical model outcome \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902"], "uncertainties": ["Pilot-estimated discordance p_d \u0914\u0930 family-ICC actual design-assumption \u0938\u0947 \u092d\u093f\u0928\u094d\u0928 \u0939\u094b \u0938\u0915\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902; N rule \u0907\u0938\u0947 pre-execution \u0938\u092e\u093e\u092f\u094b\u091c\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0917\u0940", "Manual curated alternate gold \u092a\u0930 primary effect \u0915\u093f\u0924\u0928\u093e shift \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e \u2014 unknown; \u092f\u0939\u0940 sensitivity check \u0915\u093e \u0909\u0926\u094d\u0926\u0947\u0936\u094d\u092f \u0939\u0948", "Few-shot (C3) directionality \u0915\u094b amplify \u092f\u093e dampen \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0917\u093e \u2014 pre-register \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u093f\u092f\u093e \u091c\u093e \u0938\u0915\u0924\u093e, moderated result decision table \u0915\u0947 MIXED rule \u0938\u0947 handle \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e", "Adjudicator LLM-vs-human \u03ba \u0915\u093e actual level; gate fail \u0939\u094b\u0928\u0947 \u092a\u0930 rubric revision loop \u0932\u0917\u0947\u0917\u093e", "Model version drift execution window \u0915\u0947 \u0926\u094c\u0930\u093e\u0928; logs mitigate \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902\u0917\u0947 \u092a\u0930 control \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902"], "stage": "result"}", "origin": "completion"}, "llm_response_id": "chatcmpl-89ad4980-b2b6-4340-8093-5f72727e8e2f", "security_risk": "UNKNOWN", "critic_result": null, "summary": "end_researcher_turn: {"answer": "# Final Design Document \u2014 Directional Asymmetry in LLM Retrieval of Celebrity Parent\u2013Child Relations\n**(Design-only deliverable. \u0915\u094b\u0908 experiment \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u091a\u0932\u093e\u092f\u093e \u0917\u092f\u093e; \u0915\u094b\u0908 model inference \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902; \u0915\u094b\u0908 numeric experimental outcome \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902\u0964 \u0928\u0940\u091a\u0947 \u091c\u094b \u092d\u0940 \u0938\u0902\u0916\u094d\u092f\u093e\u090f\u0901 \u0939\u0948\u0902 \u0935\u0947 design-stage \u092c\u0902\u0926-\u0930\u0942\u092a power \u0917\u0923\u0928\u093e\u090f\u0901 (statistical design arithmetic) \u0939\u0948\u0902, experiment \u0915\u0947 results \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902\u0964)**\n\n---\n\n## \u00a70 Research question \u0914\u0930 pre-registered hypotheses\n\n**Question:** \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e LLMs celebrity parent\u2013child facts \u092e\u0947\u0902 directional bias \u0926\u093f\u0916\u093e\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902 \u2014 child\u2192parent (C2P) retrieval accurate, \u092a\u0930 parent\u2192child (P2C) underperforming?\n\n- **H1 (primary, one-sided, pre-registered):** matched families \u092a\u0930 accuracy(P2C) < accuracy(C2P), direction effect statistically reliable (one-sided \u03b1 = 0.025) **\u0914\u0930** pre-specified minimum effect size \u0938\u0947 \u090a\u092a\u0930 (\u00a75-B thresholds)\u0964\n- **H0:** \u0915\u094b\u0908 reliable direction difference \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902\u0964 **H2 (counter-directional):** reliable reverse asymmetry \u2014 interpretation rules \u00a75-B \u092e\u0947\u0902 pre-specified\u0964\n- Design-neutral: \u0915\u094b\u0908 expected outcome postulate \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0917\u092f\u093e; support/null/counter \u0924\u0940\u0928\u094b\u0902 pre-registered rules \u0938\u0947 interpret \u0939\u094b\u0902\u0917\u0947\u0964\n\n**Operating definitions (fixed requirement #3 \u0915\u0947 \u0905\u0928\u0941\u0930\u0942\u092a):**\n- *\"Accurately retrieve\"* = model output \u0915\u093e gold-list (Wikidata+biography union, aliases \u0938\u092e\u0947\u0924) \u0938\u0947 rubric-\u0906\u0927\u093e\u0930\u093f\u0924 match (\u00a74)\u0964\n- *\"Underperform\"* = pooled paired direction odds ratio **OR_dir \u2264 0.80 \u0914\u0930 \u0394acc = acc(C2P) \u2212 acc(P2C) \u2265 5 percentage points**, \u0938\u093e\u0925 \u092e\u0947\u0902 reliable one-sided test; \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 criteria \u090f\u0915 \u0938\u093e\u0925 \u0905\u0928\u093f\u0935\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f\u0964\n\n---\n\n## \u00a71 Stimulus set construction\n\n**1.1 Gold source (researcher-confirmed choice: \u0935\u093f\u0915\u0932\u094d\u092a 3):**\n- Primary: **Wikidata P22 (father) / P25 (mother) / P40 (child)** \u0938\u0947 directed edges \u0916\u0940\u0902\u091a\u0928\u093e; \u0939\u0930 candidate edge \u0915\u093e **biography/IMDb cross-verification**; \u091c\u094b union \u092e\u0947\u0902 agreement \u0939\u0948 \u0935\u0947 \u0939\u0940 items; disagreements \u2192 `flagged` \u2192 primary \u0938\u0947 exclude (log maintained)\u0964\n- **Mandatory sensitivity check (fixed requirement #1):** \u090f\u0915 **fully manual curated list** (~40 families, stratification quota proportionally maintain \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0941\u090f, independent curator \u0926\u094d\u0935\u093e\u0930\u093e \u092c\u093f\u0928\u093e Wikidata \u0926\u0947\u0916\u0928\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 tier/era labels) alternate gold \u0915\u0947 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u092e\u0947\u0902; primary direction effect \u0909\u0938 \u092a\u0930 \u0926\u094b\u092c\u093e\u0930\u093e estimate \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e \u2192 exclusion-driven sample change \u0915\u093e effect report \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e\u0964\n\n**1.2 Sampling frame \u0914\u0930 size (working assumption: N = 120 families; \u00a76 \u0926\u0947\u0916\u0947\u0902):**\n- Grid quotas (per cell \u2248 10): **fame tier** {mega-famous, mid-tier, niche} \u00d7 **era** {children born pre-1970, 1970\u20132000, post-2000} \u2014 plus domain balance {film/music, politics/royalty, sports, business/other} \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0938\u0947 \u0915\u092e-\u0938\u0947-\u0915\u092e 3 domains \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u093f tier\u0964\n- Fame tier operationalization (pre-specified): reference-corpus name frequency (stable snapshot corpus, e.g., Wikipedia pageviews/abstracts snapshot) + log Wikidata sitelink count; \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u093e composite, quantile cutoffs\u0964\n- **Familiarity covariate (per entity):** held-out calibration model \u092a\u0930 single-name probe \"Who is {X}? What is {X} known for?\" \u0915\u0940 rubric-scored specificity (0\u20133) + corpus frequency\u0964 `fame_diff = log(fame_parent+1) \u2212 log(fame_child+1)`\u0964\n- **Subsets:** `parent-more-famous` (fame_diff > +0.5 log units), `child-more-famous` (< \u22120.5), `balanced` (else) \u2014 \u00a75-C \u092e\u0947\u0902 direction effect \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0905\u0932\u0917 estimate \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e\u0964\n\n**1.3 Inclusion/exclusion rules (pre-registered):**\n- Include: \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 entities standalone-notable; parent\u2013child relation gold-consistent; relation type \u2208 {biological, adoptive, legal} (type field \u092e\u0947\u0902 label; sensitivity \u092e\u0947\u0902 biological-only)\u0964\n- Exclude: live-disputed relations; gold disagreement; both entities niche-tier AND composite familiarity bottom decile (floor-effect guard \u2014 reason logged); non-human entities\u0964\n- **Name-collision protocol:** \u091c\u0939\u093e\u0901 parent/child same \u092f\u093e highly-similar name \u0930\u0916\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902 (Jr./Sr./same-name dynasty) \u2192 \u0939\u0930 probe \u092e\u0947\u0902 disambiguating appositive \u0905\u0928\u093f\u0935\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f (\"\u2026the actor born 1955\u2026\"); `collision_flag=1`; sensitivity \u092e\u0947\u0902 collision items \u0905\u0932\u0917 estimate; alias list \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 name variants gold-side\u0964\n- **Multi-child:** gold \u092a\u0915\u094d\u0937 \u092a\u0930 **children \u0915\u0940 complete list + aliases** store; answer cardinality \u00a74 \u0915\u0947 set-recall protocol \u0938\u0947 harmonize\u0964\n\n**1.4 Item file schema (JSONL, one row/family):**\n```json\n{\"family_id\":\"F041\",\"domain\":\"film\",\"tier\":\"mid\",\"era\":\"1970-2000\",\n \"parent\":{\"qid\":\"Q\u2026\",\"name\":\"\u2026\",\"aliases\":[\"\u2026\"],\"fame_logfreq\":6.1,\"fame_spec\":3,\"era\":\"1952\"},\n \"child\":{\"qid\":\"Q\u2026\",\"name\":\"\u2026\",\"aliases\":[\"\u2026\"],\"fame_logfreq\":7.0,\"fame_spec\":3},\n \"children_set\":[{\"qid\":\"\u2026\",\"name\":\"\u2026\",\"aliases\":[\"\u2026\"]}, \u2026],\n \"relation_type\":\"biological\",\"collision_flag\":0,\n \"prose_context_parent\":\"\u2026\",\"prose_context_child\":\"\u2026\",\n \"gold_source\":\"union\",\"agreement\":\"both\",\"fame_diff\":-0.9}\n```\n\n---\n\n## \u00a72 Probes \u0914\u0930 prompt formats\n\n**2.1 Probe templates (\u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u093f family, \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u093f direction, 2 equivalent templates T1/T2 \u2014 measurement-noise reduction):**\n- C2P: \"Who is the parent of {CHILD}{appositive}?\" / \"Name the father or mother of {CHILD}{appositive}.\"\n- P2C: \"Name one child of {PARENT}{appositive}.\" / \"Who is a child of {PARENT}{appositive}?\"\n- \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 directions \u092e\u0947\u0902 identical syntactic frame family; answer expectation set-recall protocol \u0938\u0947 harmonized (\u00a74)\u0964\n\n**2.2 Conditions:**\n- **C1 (primary): zero-shot direct** \u2014 \u0915\u0947\u0902 primary hypothesis test\u0964\n- **C2: zero-shot + disambiguating prose context** (1 sentence, gold-derived, direction-symmetric information load \u2014 context \u092e\u0947\u0902 target entity \u0915\u093e \u0928\u093e\u092e \u0915\u092d\u0940 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902)\u0964\n- **C3: few-shot k=5, direction-balanced** (exemplars 2 C2P + 2 P2C + 1 unrelated; exemplar families held-out test items \u0938\u0947 disjoint; exemplar order + direction counterbalanced) \u2014 directionality \u092a\u0930 few-shot \u0915\u0947 modulation \u0915\u093e own test\u0964\n- Item order \u0939\u0930 model\u00d7condition \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f seeded-randomize; direction adjacent-repeat guard (\u090f\u0915 \u0939\u0940 family \u0915\u0947 \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 probes \u2265 25 items \u0926\u0942\u0930\u0940 \u092a\u0930, order direction Counterbalanced)\u0964\n\n**2.3 Decoding:** Primary **temperature 0** (deterministic; \u091c\u0939\u093e\u0902 exact-determinism \u0928 \u092e\u093f\u0932\u0947 lowest available + logged)\u0964 Secondary: **temp 0.7 \u00d7 3 seeds** (robustness plane only; primary inference \u092e\u0947\u0902 pool \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902)\u0964\n\n---\n\n## \u00a73 Models \u0914\u0930 condition plane\n\n**3.1 Recommended plane (slots; budget confirmed \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u2014 fabricated resources \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u093f\u090f \u091c\u093e \u0930\u0939\u0947):** 4\u20136 model slots, \u22652 vendors, 2 size classes:\n| Slot | Class | \u0909\u0926\u093e\u0939\u0930\u0923-\u0935\u0930\u094d\u0917 (placeholder, commitment \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902) |\n|---|---|---|\n| M1, M2 | flagship, vendor A/B | frontier closed API |\n| M3, M4 | mid-size, vendor A/B | same vendors \u0915\u093e lighter tier |\n| M5 (, M6) | open-weight small/large | 7\u201370B class, local or hosted |\n**3.2 Documented budget fallback (fixed requirement #4):** minimal variant = **2 flagship (different vendors) + 1 open-weight** (M1, M2, M5); condition set C1+C3 only (C2 dropped); power \u00a76 \u0915\u0947 pooled-model calculation \u092e\u0947\u0902 accordingly reduce \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e \u2014 pre-registered \u0924\u094c\u0930 \u092a\u0930 declared\u0964\n**3.3 Load per model:** primary plane \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u093f model = 2 directions \u00d7 2 templates \u00d7 3 conditions \u00d7 120 families = **1,440 calls (temp-0)**; secondary plane \u092e\u0947\u0902 3\u00d7 \u0909\u0938\u0938\u0947 \u0905\u0927\u093f\u0915\u0964 Total budget table design doc \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u0925 execution phase \u092e\u0947\u0902 provide \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e\u0964\n**3.4 API/config logging:** \u0939\u0930 call \u0915\u093e raw response, config, timestamp, model version/snapshot ID append-only log \u092e\u0947\u0902 (version drift audit \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f)\u0964\n\n---\n\n## \u00a74 Scoring / adjudication rubric (pre-registered)\n\n**4.1 Correctness:**\n- C2P: output entity \u0915\u093e parent-gold (P22/P25 target; parent-side single) \u0938\u0947 match\u0964\n- P2C: **set-based recall protocol (fixed requirement #2b):** \"name any one valid child\" \u2014 model \u0915\u093e \u0915\u094b\u0908 \u092d\u0940 entity-level answer children_set \u0915\u0947 \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 member \u0938\u0947 match \u2192 correct; multi-entity answers \u092a\u0930 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u093e named entity primary scoring-target, extras \u092a\u0930 penalty \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 (log only)\u0964\n- **Sensitivity (a):** single-child-only families subset \u092a\u0930 repeat\u0964\n- Match ladder: (i) exact normalized name; (ii) alias-list hit; (iii) QID/unique-identifier mention; (iv) unresolved \u2192 adjudication\u0964\n\n**4.2 Response categories (direction-wise report \u0905\u0928\u093f\u0935\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f):** `correct` / `incorrect-entity` / `refusal` (\"don't know\") / `hedged-partial` (qualified \u092f\u093e low-confidence \u0928\u093e\u092e)\u0964 Primary analysis \u092e\u0947\u0902 refusal/hedged = incorrect; sensitivity \u092e\u0947\u0902 exclusion\u0964 Direction-wise refusal/hedged rates \u092e\u0941\u0916\u094d\u092f-table \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u2014 bias refusal-behaviour artefact \u0928 \u0939\u094b \u092f\u0939 \u0926\u093f\u0916\u093e\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f\u0964\n\n**4.3 LLM-assisted adjudication + manual double-coding:**\n- LLM adjudicator (test-plane \u0938\u0947 \u092d\u093f\u0928\u094d\u0928 model family) unresolved matches \u0915\u094b rubric \u0938\u0947 classify \u0915\u0930\u0947; adjudicator \u0915\u094b **direction label blinded** \u0930\u0939\u0947 (\u092f\u093e\u0928\u0940 \u092f\u0939 \u0928 \u092a\u0924\u093e \u0939\u094b \u092f\u0939 probe C2P \u0925\u0940 \u092f\u093e P2C \u2014 \u0635\u0631\u0641 entity-pair \u0914\u0930 answer \u0926\u093f\u0916\u0947)\u0964\n- **Manual double-coding subset:** stratified random 20% (direction \u00d7 tier \u00d7 category \u0938\u0947 strata), \u0926\u094b independent human coders, blinded\u0964 **Inter-rater agreement: Cohen's \u03ba; gate \u03ba \u2265 0.85** \u2014 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0924\u094b rubric revise \u0914\u0930 re-code\u0964 LLM-vs-human agreement \u0909\u0938\u0940 subset \u092a\u0930 report; disagreement rate direction-wise (differential grading bias \u0915\u0940 \u091c\u093e\u0901\u091a)\u0964\n\n---\n\n## \u00a75 Analysis plan (pre-registered order)\n\n**A. Primary test (plane C1, temp-0):**\n1. Per model: family-level paired accuracy, **\u0394acc**, McNemar exact test (discordant pairs), one-sided p for H1; **two-sided 95% CIs** (cluster-bootstrap over families, 10,000 resamples) \u0394acc \u0914\u0930 OR \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u2014 researcher instruction \u0915\u0947 \u0905\u0928\u0941\u0930\u0942\u092a one-sided hypothesis, two-sided CI report\u0964\n2. Pooled primary: **GLMM** `correct ~ direction + (1|family) + (1|model) + direction:model`, report OR_dir = exp(direction coefficient)\u0964\n\n**B. Pre-registered decision table (null \u0914\u0930 counter-directional \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0947 rules \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u0938\u0947):**\n| Result | Rule | Interpretation |\n|---|---|---|\n| Reliable one-sided (\u03b1=.025) AND OR\u22640.80 AND \u0394acc\u22655pp | SUPPORT | H1 supported (claim only for tested model plane) |\n| Reliable \u092a\u0930 OR>0.80 \u092f\u093e \u0394acc<5pp | PARTIAL/SMALL | statistically detectable \u092a\u0930 practically small \u2014 effect-size-first report |\n| Not reliable, CI excludes OR\u22640.80 \u0914\u0930 OR\u22651.25 | NULL | practical-equivalence language + power caveat |\n| Reliable reverse AND OR\u207b\u00b9 thresholds meet | COUNTER | H2 supported |\n| Direction \u0935\u093f\u0930\u0941\u0926\u094d\u0927 models/conditions \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092d\u093f\u0928\u094d\u0928 | MIXED | moderation \u0915\u0947 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u092e\u0947\u0902 report; cherry-picking \u092e\u0928\u093e \u2014 interaction test \u0938\u0947 support \u091a\u093e\u0939\u093f\u090f |\n| \u00a75-C confound checks fail (\u0928\u0940\u091a\u0947) | CONFOUND-SUSPECT | headline claim withhold; confound-adjusted result primary |\n\n**C. Confound-isolation battery (fixed design strength):**\n- **Fame:** GLMM `correct ~ direction + fame_diff + direction:fame_subset + era + tier + child_count + collision_flag + relation_type + (1|family) + (1|model)`\u0964 Pass-criterion: direction effect `parent-more-famous` \u0914\u0930 `child-more-famous` \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 subsets \u092e\u0947\u0902 same-signed \u0930\u0939\u0947 (fame-asymmetry artefact \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u092f\u0939\u0940 fingerprint \u0939\u0948); direction:fame_subset interaction formally test\u0964\n- **Exposure/recency:** era-stratified effects; post-2000-children (low-training-exposure proxy) subset \u2014 leakage definitive control \u0938\u0902\u092d\u0935 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902, \u0907\u0938\u0947 Limitation \u092e\u0947\u0902 report (researcher-confirmed policy: \u091b\u093f\u092a\u093e\u0928\u093e \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902)\u0964\n- **Cardinality:** \u00a74 \u0915\u0947 single-child sensitivity \u0938\u0947 answer-set-size artefact \u0905\u0932\u0917\u0964\n\n**D. Sensitivity battery (pre-listed, secondary):** (1) **alternate manual-curated gold \u092a\u0930 primary re-estimation (fixed requirement #1, \u0905\u0928\u093f\u0935\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f)**; (2) single-child-only; (3) mega-famous-only; (4) pre-cutoff era only; (5) C1 vs C3 (few-shot moderation); (6) temp-0 vs temp-0.7 seeds; (7) refusal-as-exclusion; (8) collision items excluded\u0964\n\n**E. Multiplicity:** Primary = C1 temp-0 pooled direction test (\u090f\u0915)\u0964 \u0938\u092c \u0915\u0941\u091b secondary; secondary family \u092e\u0947\u0902 BH-FDR; decision table \u0915\u093e SUPPORT \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932 primary + confound-pass \u092a\u0930\u0964\n\n---\n\n## \u00a76 Power \u0914\u0930 coverage rationale (fixed requirement #5 \u2014 pilot \u092a\u0930 \u091f\u093e\u0932\u0928\u093e \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902)\n\n**Method 1 (closed-form reference, McNemar/family-level, Bender et al. formula; design-stage computation):** input working assumptions: N=120 families, mean accuracy \u22480.80 \u2192 discordance p_d \u22480.20, one-sided \u03b1=0.025, power=0.80\u0964 **\u0917\u0923\u0928\u093e-\u092a\u0930\u093f\u0923\u093e\u092e (design arithmetic, experimental result \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902):** \u0907\u0938 plane \u092e\u0947\u0902 detectable-effect limit **OR \u2248 0.28** (\u0905\u0930\u094d\u0925\u093e\u0924\u094d N=120 single-attempt \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932 strong asymmetry \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f powered \u0939\u0948)\u0964 Reference gradient: N=200 \u2192 OR\u22480.39; N=350 \u2192 OR\u22480.50\u0964 **\u0928\u093f\u0939\u093f\u0924\u093e\u0930\u094d\u0925 honestly pre-registered:** N=120 \u092a\u0930 null \u092e\u093f\u0932\u0928\u0947 \u092a\u0930 \"no effect\" \u0915\u0939\u0928\u093e invalid \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e (underpowered zone OR\u2208(0.28,0.80)); decision table \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092f\u0939 caveat fixed \u0939\u0948\u0964\n**Method 2 (primary power basis \u2014 probe-level GLMM simulation, fully specified):** execution-\u092a\u0942\u0930\u094d\u0935 simulation (\u0915\u094b\u0908 model involvement \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902, pure statistics): inputs = pilot \u0938\u0947 estimated p_d, per-family ICC \u03c1 (gold-fact difficulty clustering), k=2 templates/direction, between-model correlation; generator = logistic GLMM with direction OR grid {0.2\u20261.0}; 2,000 sims/point; **N selection rule:** N = smallest {120, 180, 240, 350} \u091c\u093f\u0938\u092e\u0947\u0902 **OR=0.5 \u092a\u0930 \u226580% power** (probe-level) \u092e\u093f\u0932\u0947; quota grid proportional scale\u0964 Working assumption N=120 coverage floor \u0930\u0939\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948; simulated requirement >120 \u0939\u094b \u0924\u094b N \u090a\u092a\u0930 \u092c\u0922\u093c\u0947\u0917\u093e \u2014 decision execution \u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 pre-registration addendum \u092e\u0947\u0902 freeze\u0964\n**Pilot = refinement only:** ~20 families \u00d7 1 model, \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932 p_d/ICC/fame-distribution estimate \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f; hypothesis test \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902; pilot data final items \u092e\u0947\u0902 reuse \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902\u0964\n\n---\n\n## \u00a77 Pre-registration checklist (execution \u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 freeze)\n\u2610 Hypotheses H1/H0/H2 + one-sided \u03b1=0.025 \u2610 Primary metric + plane (C1 temp-0 pooled GLMM) \u2610 Effect-size thresholds (OR\u22640.80, \u0394acc\u22655pp) \u2610 Decision table (\u00a75-B) \u2610 Exclusion rules (\u00a71.3) + gold-disagreement log \u2610 Condition/model plane \u092f\u093e declared fallback \u2610 Scoring rubric + \u03ba\u22650.85 gate + adjudicator blinding \u2610 Power method + N rule (\u00a76) \u2610 **Stopping rules: fixed N; \u0915\u094b\u0908 interim significance peeking \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902; pilot \u0938\u0947 parameters update allowed, hypotheses \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902; \u0915\u094b\u0908 post-hoc threshold change \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u2014 deviations deviation-log \u092e\u0947\u0902, primary unaffected** \u2610 Analysis scripts code-reviewed \u0935 freeze \u2610 Deviation policy + reporting checklist (all conditions reported, failures \u0938\u092e\u0947\u0924)\u0964\n\n---\n\n## \u00a78 Feasibility \u0914\u0930 artifact plan (design-only delivery)\n- **\u0905\u092d\u0940 delivered (\u092f\u0939 document):** rationale, controls, sampling + gold protocol, templates, scoring rubric, decision rules, analysis spec + \u0928\u0940\u091a\u0947 pseudo-code, power methods (\u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902) + computed reference tables, pre-registration checklist\u0964\n- **Sandbox inventory (design-stage facts, experiment \u0915\u0947 proof \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902):** /workspace \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932 task.json; \u0915\u094b\u0908 dataset/code/eval scaffolding \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902; \u0915\u094b\u0908 ML library \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902; network disabled \u2014 \u0905\u0924\u0903 stimulus acquisition (Wikidata dump/API), model inference \u0914\u0930 pilot \u0938\u092c **execution phase \u092e\u0947\u0902, deferred**\u0964 Design \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0907\u0928\u0915\u0940 \u0906\u0935\u0936\u094d\u092f\u0915\u0924\u093e \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0925\u0940\u0964\n- **Execution phase \u0915\u094b \u091a\u093e\u0939\u093f\u090f:** network \u092f\u093e pre-supplied Wikidata dump + snapshot corpus; model API access/weights; `pandas, statsmodels/brms (R), scipy`; artifact layout: `items.jsonl`, `raw_responses.jsonl`, `scores.csv`, `analysis/01_primary.py\u202604_sensitivity.py`\u0964\n\n## \u00a79 Spec / pseudo-code\n```python\n# --- item build (execution phase) ---\nfor pair in wikidata_edges(P22|P25|P40):\n    v = cross_verify_biography_IMDb(pair)          # 0/1/uncertain\n    if v == \"both\": item = make_item(pair)         # union primary\n    elif v == \"disagree\": log_and_exclude(pair)\nitem = assign_quotas(tier, era, domain); add_fame(item); flag_collisions(item)\nassert children_set_complete(item) and aliases_loaded(item)\n\n# --- runner ---\nfor model in MODEL_SLOTS:                          # recommended \u092f\u093e declared fallback\n  for cond in [C1, C2, C3]:                        # C1 primary\n    order = seeded_shuffle(items, model, cond)     # direction-repeat guard\n    for item in order:\n      for direction in [C2P, P2C]:\n        for template in [T1, T2]:\n          call_and_log(model, cond, direction, template, item, temp=0)\n  if PLANE.secondary: secondary_plane(model, temp=0.7, seeds=[s1,s2,s3])\n\n# --- scoring ---\nfor resp in raw_responses:\n    label = match_ladder(resp, gold_for(resp.direction))   # exact|alias|qid|unresolved\n    if label is None: label = adjudicate_blinded(resp)     # direction-label blinded LLM\nkappa = irr_check(double_coded_20pct_subset())             # gate: kappa >= 0.85\n\n# --- analysis (pre-registered order) ---\nprimary: per-model McNemar + bootstrap CIs  ->  pooled GLMM:\n    correct ~ direction + (1|family) + (1|model) + direction:model\nconfound: correct ~ direction + fame_diff + direction:fame_subset + era + tier\n          + child_count + collision_flag + relation_type + (1|family) + (1|model)\ndecision_table(primary, confound_checks)   # thresholds: OR<=0.80, dAcc>=5pp, p_1side<.025\nsensitivity: [manual_curated_gold, single_child_only, mega_famous_only,\n              pre_cutoff_only, C1_vs_C3, temp0_vs_seeds, refusal_excluded]  # BH-FDR\n```\n\n## \u00a710 Limitations (honest, fixed policy)\n(1) Training-exposure definitive control \u0905\u0938\u0902\u092d\u0935 \u2014 era/familiarity proxies, limita